        "findings": [
          "The retained embedder emits the observed backing-store error when the create callback returns false; the Rust callback maps None to false.",
          "Denial passes a null custom render task runner, using the engine-managed raster thread.",
          "FlutterEngineShutdown calls Deinitialize, which collects shell and thread host. ThreadHost owns unique fml::Thread values; the destructor joins them.",
          "Successful thread joining does not establish that the EGL implementation released a current context; BAD_ACCESS cause remains unresolved.",
          "Shell::RenderOutputs posts PrepareDenialRenderOutputs or DrawDenialRenderOutputs to the raster task runner and returns before execution.",
          "The Rust broker expiry uses two output tick intervals without an engine queue-completion acknowledgment. A delayed queued request can therefore outlive its authorization; the VM audit identifies missing authorization but does not tag which expiry/consumption/cancellation preceded each callback.",
          "Missing pool, ReadyHandoff and no reusable slot were not observed in this diagnostic run. Do not change GBM allocation or enlarge the pool on the basis of the old aggregate label."
        ]
      }
    },
